 "     Lunar eclipse ": "",
 "The moon between the sun and the earth: its shadow falls on us. A solar eclipse.": "",
 "The earth between the sun and the moon: the moon goes dark and red. A lunar eclipse.": "",
 "Anaxagoras in Athens. A stone that fell from the sky.": "",
 "Chapter 9 waits in the Agora of Athens. Take Captain Nausikles’ ship to Piraeus.": "",
 "Meet Anaxagoras in the Agora": "",
 "Kleon the Younger": "",
 "Athenians! This foreigner says the Sun is a stone. And last night, the gods answered him: a stone fell from the sky, burning!": "",
 "Or the sky answered nothing, and a stone fell, as stones do. Let us go and look at it before the priests carry it off and call it a god.": "",
 ", npc: aspasia, text: ": "",
 "The Stone from the Sky: reach the crater before the priests": "",
 ", npc: anaxagoras, text: ": "",
 "Nous Chip": "",
 "The control processor of Nico’s machine, embedded in a piece of its casing that fell outside Athens. Part 9 of 13.": "",
 "Everything in Everything: Anaxagoras’ experiment": "",
 "Here is my question. We eat bread. Bread becomes our hair, our flesh, our bones. How can hair come from what is not hair?": "",
 "Because there’s a portion of everything in everything.": "",
 "Yes! In bread, tiny portions of hair and flesh, too small to see. What we call bread is only what there is most of.": "",
 "The gods turn it into hair.": "",
 "Then the gods are very busy barbers. Think again.": "",
 "Bread and hair are the same thing.": "",
 "Then why don’t you eat your hair? Think again.": "",
 "The Star Map: show Anaxagoras how eclipses work": "",
 "The Star Map: wait for night with Anaxagoras": "",
 "Show how eclipses work": "",
 "Wait for night": "",
 "You see it as I do. The moon borrows its light. Tomorrow they will try me for saying so.": "",
 "The Trial: defend Anaxagoras before the jury in the Agora": "",
 "Five hundred and one jurors! He calls the Sun a stone and the gods a lie. Impiety! Exile him!": "",
 "The truth: the stone is metal, from the future. My future.": "",
 ", npc: kleonY, text: ": "",
 "A convenient lie: it is a gift from the gods to Athens.": "",
 "The Mind’s Workshop: look around": "",
