 "Force the shuttered door": "",
 "Look at the calendar on the wall": "",
 "A calendar written in advance": "",
 "In the Stranger’s workshop in Athens: tools from 2026, models of every mechanism, a map with thirteen pins, and a calendar with the day of Nico’s arrival circled years in advance. End of Act II.": "",
 "Anaxagoras of Clazomenae": "",
 "A foreigner in Athens. Nous, Mind, set the cosmos whirling and orders all things; “there is a portion of everything in everything”. He explained eclipses correctly and said the Sun was a red-hot stone, and was prosecuted for impiety and left Athens.": "",
